From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Otto=20Pfl=C3=BCger?= <otto.pflueger@abscue.de>
Date: Fri, 11 Jul 2025 08:23:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 091/225] media: platform: sprd: add Unisoc ISP driver
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Unisoc ISP operates as a memory-to-memory device and supports
Bayer-to-YUV and YUV-to-YUV image format conversion, processing and
resizing. In order to support advanced userspace configuration for the
ISP blocks, the ISP is implemented as a media pipeline rather than a
simple V4L M2M converter.

Signed-off-by: Otto Pflüger <otto.pflueger@abscue.de>
